&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Engaging with customers, including helping with integration questions, or answering questions during technical sales calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ed16aa5bc2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ensuring clean lint and implementation reports for IP blocks and subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;b0fdf9945c0c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;4b42e7e35ac1&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Confidence in planning out a project development cycle and coordinating with project managers as development progresses.&lt;/li&gt;
