&lt;li&gt;Track record of closing new logo deals in the $100k–$1M+ ARR range with consistent overachievement against revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SaaS financial metrics and enterprise buying dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
